      "tocPath": "Syndicator/Syndicator.toc",
      "notes": "plusmouse's add-ons download from Wago: the author disabled CurseForge API downloads. CurseForge's published hashes are used to cross-check the Wago file."
    },
    {
      "id": "whatstraining",
      "name": "What's Training?",
      "author": "sveng",
      "summary": "Lists the spells your class trainer can teach you, in the spellbook.",
